    "created_at": "2014-07-29T12:41:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2014-07-29T12:41:16Z",
    "body": "Technically it's a spec bug if the spec author uses `[SameObject]` and then requires in prose that a different object is returned at some point. So it is an \"enforcement\" as long as the spec has no bugs!\n",
