    "created_at": "2015-08-13T05:35:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-08-13T05:35:14Z",
    "body": "IDL describes instances and `[SameObject]` only pertains to an instance. It knows nothing about underlying objects. So yes, that is working as expected.\n",
